T*
(ACME PETROCHEMICAL DEMO COMPLEX - UNIT 2300) Tj
T*
(PROCESS DATA SHEET: PRESSURE RELIEF VALVES \(API 520 / API 526\)) Tj
T*
(Document Code: DS-PS-0018 | Revision: Z1 | Status: Issued for Construction) Tj
T*
(Process Unit: Unit 2300 \(Decomposition & Recovery Section\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PSV-2304A / PSV-2304B \(PROTECTING DECOMPOSER REACTOR D-2304\)) Tj
T*
(- Protected Equipment: D-2304 \(Decomposer Reactor\)) Tj
T*
(- Tag Numbers: PSV-2304A \(Active\) / PSV-2304B \(100% Spare via 3-Way Selector Valve\)) Tj
T*
(- Valve Type: Balanced Bellows Spring-Loaded Relief Valve with Rupture Pin Buckling Assist) Tj
T*
(- Set Pressure: 11.0 kg/cm2g \(Matches DS-D2304 Design Pressure of 11.0 kg/cm2g; Note: P&ID PID-23-0013 note states 12.2 kg/cm2g vessel rating\)) Tj
T*
(- Relieving Temperature: 185.0 degC \(Two-Phase Flashing Phenol/Acetone/Cumene Mixture\)) Tj
T*
