T*
(- Required Relieving Rate: 38,400 kg/hr) Tj
T*
(- Selected API 526 Orifice: 4J6 \(4 in 300# Inlet x 6 in 150# Outlet, Effective Area 8.303 cm2\)) Tj
T*
(- Body & Trim Material: 316L Stainless Steel / Hastelloy C-276 Bellows) Tj
T*
(- Discharge Destination: Acid Aromatics Relief Header to Knock-Out Drum D-2320 \(PID-23-0022\)) Tj
T*
